    <briefdescription>
<para>RAII token-reservation handle returned by <computeroutput>allocate()</computeroutput>. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The handle owns a reservation of <computeroutput><ref refid="classthemis_1_1prompt__engineering_1_1_budget_handle_1a970ae0acb7f80e16d83c5694e4d520af" kindref="member">tokens()</ref></computeroutput> tokens on the budget manager. Tokens are automatically released when the handle is destroyed or when <computeroutput><ref refid="classthemis_1_1prompt__engineering_1_1_budget_handle_1a95d0cfa2a22acdb3daaf4eaefebeaf78" kindref="member">release()</ref></computeroutput> is called explicitly. Handles are move-only; copying is intentionally disabled to prevent double-releases. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
